{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36235","headline":"越中言事二首 二 · 方干","name":"越中言事二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云霞水木共苍苍，元化分功秀一方。\n百里湖波轻撼月，五更军角慢吹霜。\n沙边贾客喧鱼市，岛上潜夫醉笋庄。\n终岁逍遥仁术内，无名甘老买臣乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}